  "rationale": "Amended after the Phase 2.14 candidate-materialization readiness audit. NO-BREAK SPACE (U+00A0) is not a standalone punctuation/Braille character rule in this project. The observed Liblouis operand 'a' is a virtual/internal space operand, not a publishable Braille cell, and NBSP translation/layout semantics are already owned by FA-WS-007. The scalar punctuation decision is therefore out of scope to avoid a duplicate specification artifact."
